# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# nyra-desktop: system units of the desktop's packages that stay off (image/units.list, docs/IMAGE.md
# "Services"). systemd applies presets at the first boot, which would enable them otherwise.
# accounts-daemon: D-Bus starts it when a program asks.
disable accounts-daemon.service
# DrKonqi's crash report processor: it needs systemd-coredump, which the base does not have.
disable drkonqi-coredump-processor@.service
# cups: started by cups.socket and cups.path, when a program prints or a job is queued.
disable cups.service
